{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>Shall be banned</b> — three times in the Masorah: כל חרם אשר יחרם / לא יפדה / זובח לאלהים יחרם — יחרם כל רכושו: to say, just as those liable to death — we do not take money and absolve him, so too those liable to monetary payment — we may not absolve him until he pays. And this is יחרם כל רכושו, which is stated concerning one liable to monetary payment, juxtaposed to זובח לאלהים יחרם, which is one liable to death — for in both of them I say: לא יפדה."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:53.113040553Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}